{"type":"message","id":"08bf072a","parentId":"5374260d","timestamp":"2026-05-26T05:40:22.629Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### Reasoning Summary\nThe RSS feeds were fetched and analyzed to identify the most significant, cross-covered crypto story published within the last 24 hours. Vitalik Buterin's major announcement regarding the restructuring and refocusing of the Ethereum Foundation on the \"CROPS\" framework was covered across CoinDesk, Decrypt, and CryptoSlate. After performing a history duplicate check to verify the topic was completely fresh, the articles' contents were extracted using `trafilatura` and aggregated into a validated structured JSON format written directly to the designated file.\n\nSUCCESS"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","usage":{"input":2602,"output":149,"cacheRead":19284,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22035,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779774019731,"responseId":"RTIVaq7XEars694PlvzqmQI"}}
